{
  "id": "33096_akehanasu",
  "headword": "{開|あ}け{放|はな}す",
  "reading": "あけはなす",
  "romaji": "akehanasu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan, transitive)",
  "gloss": "to throw open; to leave wide open",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to throw open; to leave wide open",
      "explanation": "To open a door, window and so on all the way, or to leave it fully open for some time."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33096_akehanasu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{開|あ}け{放|はな}す。",
      "english": "I throw the windows open.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33096_akehanasu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{戸|と}→戸：00676_to⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{開|あ}け{放|はな}したまま⟦{出|で}かけて→出かける：00833_dekakeru⟧しまった。",
      "english": "I went out leaving the door wide open.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33096_akehanasu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{天気|てんき}→天気：00582_tenki⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦いい→いい：00118_ii⟧⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦{家中|いえじゅう}→家中：31767_iejuu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{開|あ}け{放|はな}して⟦{風|かぜ}→風：00641_kaze⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{通|とお}す→通す：02300_toosu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{好|す}き→好き：02355_suki⟧だ。",
      "english": "On fine days I like to throw open all the windows in the house and let the breeze through.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n⟦{開|あ}ける→開ける：00563_akeru⟧ (to open) + ⟦{放|はな}す→放す：29986_hanasu⟧ (to let go), so \"open and leave it that way\".\n\nUSAGE:\nOften with 〜たまま or 〜て, describing a door or window deliberately left open. {開|あ}け{放|はな}つ is a more literary variant with the same meaning. A door left open through carelessness is usually ⟦{開|あ}け→開ける：00563_akeru⟧っ{放|ぱな}し, the informal noun form.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{開|あ}け{放|はな}す: to throw the windows open\n- {開|あ}け{放|はな}した⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧: a room with everything wide open",
